#: amp.i18n.php:280
msgid ""
"Call Recording Policy used to resove the winner in a conflict between two "
"extensions when one wants a call recorded and the other does not, if both "
"their priorities are also the same."
msgstr "通話錄音原則用於解決兩支分機之間的衝突：當一方希望錄音、另一方不希望錄音，且兩者優先順序相同時，以此原則決定勝出的一方。"

#: ../core/functions.inc.php:4987
msgid "Call Screening"
msgstr "來電篩選"

#: ../core/functions.inc.php:4987
msgid ""
"Call Screening requires external callers to say their name, which will be "
"played back to the user and allow the user to accept or reject the call.  "
"Screening with memory only verifies a caller for their CallerID once. "
"Screening without memory always requires a caller to say their name. Either "
"mode will always announce the caller based on the last introduction saved "
"with that CallerID. If any user on the system uses the memory option, when "
"that user is called, the caller will be required to re-introduce themselves "
"and all users on the system will have that new introduction associated with "
"the caller's CallerID."
msgstr ""
"來電篩選要求外部來電者說出自己的姓名，系統會將錄音播放給使用者聽，並讓使用者選擇接受或拒絕該通來電。使用記憶功能的篩選模式只會對來電者的來電顯示驗證一次。不使用記憶功能的篩選模式則每次都要求來電者說出自己的姓名。無論哪種模式，系統都會依據該來電顯示最後儲存的自我介紹來播報來電者。若系統中有任何使用者使用記憶選項，當該使用者接到來電時，來電者將被要求重新自我介紹，且系統中所有使用者都會將該新介紹與來電者的來電顯示建立關聯。"

