"DAHDi channels are referenced either by a group number or channel number "
"(which is defined in chan_dahdi.conf).  <br><br>The default setting is "
"<b>g0</b> (group zero)."
msgstr ""
"DAHDi 通道可透過群組編號或通道編號（定義於 chan_dahdi.conf 中）來參照。<br><br>預設設定為 <b>g0</b>（第零群組）。"

