#: amp.i18n.php:340
msgid ""
"Default maximum number of outbound simultaneous calls that an extension can "
"make. This is also very useful as a Security Protection against a system "
"that has been compromised. It will limit the number of simultaneous calls "
"that can be made on the compromised extension. This default is used when an "
"extension is created. A default of 0 means no limit."
msgstr ""
"分機可進行的外撥同時通話數的預設上限。此設定在系統遭入侵時也是非常有用的安全防護，可限制遭入侵的分機所能進行的同時通話數。此預設值會在建立分機時套用。預設值 0 表示不限制。"

#: amp.i18n.php:384
#: ../core/install.php:511
msgid ""
"Default number of seconds to ring phones before sending callers to voicemail "
"or other extension destinations. This can be set per extension/user. Phones "
"with no voicemail or other destination options will ring indefinitely."
msgstr ""
"在將來電者轉至語音信箱或其他分機目的地之前，電話響鈴的預設秒數。此設定可依分機/使用者個別設定。沒有語音信箱或其他目的地選項的電話將無限期響鈴。"

#: amp.i18n.php:226
msgid ""
"Default setting for (new Extension)  SIP encryption. Whether to offer SRTP "
"encrypted media (and only SRTP encrypted media) on outgoing calls to a peer. "
"Calls will fail with HANGUPCAUSE=58 if the peer does not support SRTP. See "
"Asterisk documentation for details."
msgstr ""
"（新分機）SIP 加密的預設設定。是否在對等端的外撥通話中提供 SRTP 加密媒體（且僅提供 SRTP 加密媒體）。若對等端不支援 SRTP，通話將以 HANGUPCAUSE=58 失敗。詳細資訊請參閱 Asterisk 文件。"

#: amp.i18n.php:238
msgid ""
"Default setting for (new Extension) SIP and IAX allow (for codecs). Codecs "
"to allow in addition to those set in general settings unless explicitly "
"'disallowed' for the device. Values van be separated with '&' e.g. "
"'ulaw&g729&g729' where the preference order is preserved. See Asterisk "
"documentation for details."
msgstr ""
"（新分機）SIP 與 IAX 的 allow（編解碼器）預設設定。除了一般設定中所列的編解碼器之外，允許使用的編解碼器，除非已針對裝置明確「停用」。值可用「&」分隔，例如「ulaw&g729&g729」，其中會保留偏好順序。詳細資訊請參閱 Asterisk 文件。"

#: amp.i18n.php:242
msgid ""
"Default setting for (new Extension) SIP and IAX disallow (for codecs). "
"Codecs to disallow, can help to reset from the general settings by setting a "
"value of 'all' and then specifically including allowed codecs with the "
"'allow' directive. Values van be separated with '&' e.g. 'g729&g722'. See "
"Asterisk documentation for details."
msgstr ""
"（新分機）SIP 與 IAX 的 disallow（編解碼器）預設設定。要停用的編解碼器；可將值設為「all」，再以「allow」指令明確加入允許的編解碼器，藉此重設一般設定。值可用「&」分隔，例如「g729&g722」。詳細資訊請參閱 Asterisk 文件。"

#: amp.i18n.php:234
msgid ""
"Default setting for (new Extension) SIP and IAX qualify. Whether to send "
"periodic OPTIONS messages (for SIP) or otherwise monitor the channel, and at "
"what point to consider the channel unavailable. A value of 'yes' is "
"equivalent to 2000, time in msec. Can help to keep NAT holes open with SIP "
"but not dependable for remote client firewalls. See Asterisk documentation "
"for details."
msgstr ""
"（新分機）SIP 與 IAX 的 qualify 預設設定。是否定期傳送 OPTIONS 訊息（適用於 SIP）或以其他方式監控通道，以及在何種情況下將通道視為不可用。值「yes」等同於 2000（單位為毫秒）。有助於在 SIP 下維持 NAT 通道開啟，但對遠端使用者端防火牆並不可靠。詳細資訊請參閱 Asterisk 文件。"

#: amp.i18n.php:206
msgid ""
"Default setting for (new Extension) SIP canreinvite (same as directmedia). "
"See Asterisk documentation for details."
msgstr "（新分機）SIP canreinvite（等同於 directmedia）的預設設定。詳細資訊請參閱 Asterisk 文件。"

#: amp.i18n.php:222
msgid ""
"Default setting for (new Extension) SIP nat. A 'yes' will attempt to handle "
"nat, also works for local (uses the network ports and address instead of the "
"reported ports), 'no' follows the protocol, 'never' tries to block it, no "
"RFC3581, 'route' ignores the rport information. See Asterisk documentation "
"for details."
msgstr ""
"（新分機）SIP nat 的預設設定。「yes」會嘗試處理 NAT，也適用於本機（使用網路通訊埠與位址，而非回報的通訊埠）；「no」遵循協定；「never」會嘗試封鎖 NAT，且不使用 RFC3581；「route」會忽略 rport 資訊。詳細資訊請參閱 Asterisk 文件。"

#: amp.i18n.php:230
msgid ""
"Default setting for (new Extension) SIP qualifyfreq. Only valid for Asterisk "
"1.6 and above. Frequency that 'qualify' OPTIONS messages will be sent to the "
"device. Can help to keep NAT holes open but not dependable for remote client "
"firewalls. See Asterisk documentation for details."
msgstr ""
"（新分機）SIP qualifyfreq 的預設設定。僅適用於 Asterisk 1.6 及以上版本。「qualify」OPTIONS 訊息傳送至裝置的頻率。有助於維持 NAT 通道開啟，但對遠端使用者端防火牆並不可靠。詳細資訊請參閱 Asterisk 文件。"

#: amp.i18n.php:218
msgid ""
"Default setting for (new Extension) SIP sendrpid. A value of 'yes' is "
"equivalent to 'rpid' and will send the 'Remote-Party-ID' header. A value of "
"'pai' will send the 'P-Asserted-Identity' header. See Asterisk documentation "
"for details."
msgstr ""
"（新分機）SIP sendrpid 的預設設定。值「yes」等同於「rpid」，會傳送「Remote-Party-ID」標頭。值「pai」會傳送「P-Asserted-Identity」標頭。詳細資訊請參閱 Asterisk 文件。"

#: amp.i18n.php:214
msgid ""
"Default setting for (new Extension) SIP trustrpid. See Asterisk "
"documentation for details."
msgstr "（新分機）SIP trustrpid 的預設設定。詳細資訊請參閱 Asterisk 文件。"

#: amp.i18n.php:246
msgid ""
"Default setting for (new Extension) SIP, DAHDi (and Zap) callgroup. "
"Callgroup(s) that the device is part of, can be one or more callgroups, e.g. "
"'1,3-5' would be in groups 1,3,4,5. See Asterisk documentation for details."
msgstr ""
"（新分機）SIP、DAHDi（與 Zap）callgroup 的預設設定。裝置所屬的通話群組，可為一個或多個群組，例如「1,3-5」表示屬於群組 1、3、4、5。詳細資訊請參閱 Asterisk 文件。"

#: amp.i18n.php:250
msgid ""
"Default setting for (new Extension) SIP, DAHDi (and Zap) pickupgroup. "
"Pickupgroups(s) that the device can pickup calls from, can be one or more "
"groups, e.g. '1,3-5' would be in groups 1,3,4,5. Device does not have to be "
"in a group to be able to pickup calls from that group. See Asterisk "
"documentation for details."
msgstr ""
"（新分機）SIP、DAHDi（與 Zap）pickupgroup 的預設設定。裝置可代接通話的群組，可為一個或多個群組，例如「1,3-5」表示群組 1、3、4、5。裝置不需要屬於某個群組，也能代接該群組的通話。詳細資訊請參閱 Asterisk 文件。"

#: amp.i18n.php:360
msgid ""
"Default setting for new extensions. When set to Intercom, calls to new "
"extensions/users from other internal users act as if they were intercom "
"calls meaning they will be auto-answered if the endpoint supports this "
"feature and the system is configured to operate in this mode. All the normal "
"white list and black list settings will be honored if they are set. External "
"calls will still ring as normal, as will certain other circumstances such as "
"blind transfers and when a Follow Me is configured and enabled. If Disabled, "
"the phone rings as a normal phone."
msgstr ""
"新分機的預設設定。設為 Intercom 時，其他內部使用者撥打新分機/使用者的電話會如同對講通話一般，也就是說，若端點支援此功能且系統已設定以此模式運作，電話便會自動接聽。所有一般的白名單與黑名單設定，若有設定皆會生效。外部來電仍會正常響鈴，其他某些情況亦然，例如盲目轉接，以及在已設定並啟用 Follow Me 時。若設為停用，電話會像一般電話一樣響鈴。"

#: ../core/functions.inc/drivers/Sip.class.php:326
msgid ""
"Default user setting for this device, almost always empty for dynamic "
"endpoints or equals to extension number for multiple endpoints residing on "
"the same IP (VoIP Gateways)."
msgstr "此裝置的預設使用者設定；對動態端點而言幾乎一律為空白，或等於位於相同 IP 上之多個端點（VoIP 閘道器）的分機號碼。"

#: ../core/functions.inc/drivers/PJSip.class.php:328
msgid "Defaults and enables some options that are relevant to WebRTC"
msgstr "預設並啟用部分與 WebRTC 相關的選項"

#: amp.i18n.php:760
msgid ""
"Defaults to 077 allowing only the asterisk user to have any permission on VM "
"files. If set to something like 007, it would allow the group to have "
"permissions. This can be used if setting apache to a different user then "
"asterisk, so that the apache user can have access to read/write/delete the "
"voicemail files. If changed, some of the voicemail directory structures may "
"have to be manually changed."
msgstr ""
"預設為 077，僅允許 asterisk 使用者對語音信箱檔案擁有任何權限。若設為 007 之類的值，則允許群組擁有權限。若將 apache 設定為不同於 asterisk 的使用者，即可使用此設定，讓 apache 使用者得以讀取/寫入/刪除語音信箱檔案。若加以變更，部分語音信箱目錄結構可能必須手動調整。"

