#: amp.i18n.php:680
msgid ""
"Determine where to send log information if the log is enabled ('Disable "
"FreePBX Log' (AMPDISABLELOG) false. There are two places to route the log "
"messages. 'FILE' will send all log messages to the defined 'FreePBX Log "
"File' (FPBX_LOG_FILE). All the other settings will route the log messages to "
"your System Logging subsystem (syslog) using the specified log level. Syslog "
"can be configured to route different levels to different locations. See "
"'syslog' documentation (man syslog) on your system for more details."
msgstr ""
"決定啟用日誌（「Disable FreePBX Log」（AMPDISABLELOG）為 false）時，要將記錄資訊送往何處。有兩個可傳送日誌訊息的位置。「FILE」會將所有日誌訊息傳送至所定義的「FreePBX Log File」（FPBX_LOG_FILE）。所有其他設定則會以指定的日誌層級，將日誌訊息傳送至您的系統日誌子系統（syslog）。您可以設定 syslog 將不同層級傳送至不同位置。更多詳細資訊請參閱您系統上的「syslog」文件（man syslog）。"

