#: ../core/views/trunks/trunk_header.php:335
msgid ""
"Determines what CIDs will be allowed out this trunk. IMPORTANT: EMERGENCY "
"CIDs defined on an extension/device will ALWAYS be used if this trunk is "
"part of an EMERGENCY Route regardless of these settings.<br />Allow Any CID: "
"all CIDs including foreign CIDS from forwarded external calls will be "
"transmitted.<br />Block Foreign CIDs: Sets any CID that is the result of a "
"forwarded call from off the system to the Outbound CallerID defined for the "
"trunk. If no Outbound CallerID is defined for the trunk, the Foreign CID "
"will be sent unchanged. CIDs defined for extensions/users are transmitted."
"<br />Remove CNAM: this will remove CNAM from any CID sent out this "
"trunk<br />Force Trunk CID: Always use the CID defined for this trunk except "
"if part of any EMERGENCY Route with an EMERGENCY CID defined for the "
"extension/device."
msgstr ""
"決定哪些 CID 允許透過此中繼撥出。重要：無論這些設定為何，只要此中繼屬於緊急路由的一部分，在分機/裝置上定義的緊急 CID 一律會使用。<br />允許任何 CID：會傳送所有 CID，包括來自轉接外部來電的外部 CID。<br />封鎖外部 CID：將系統外轉接來電所產生的任何 CID 設為此中繼定義的外撥來電顯示。若此中繼未定義外撥來電顯示，則會原封不動地送出外部 CID。分機/使用者定義的 CID 會照常傳送。<br />移除 CNAM：會從此中繼送出的任何 CID 中移除 CNAM。<br />強制使用中繼 CID：一律使用此中繼定義的 CID，除非該通話屬於帶有分機/裝置緊急 CID 定義的緊急路由。"

