#: ../core/functions.inc/drivers/PJSip.class.php:300
msgid ""
"For Message Waiting indicators there are three types: Auto, Solicited and "
"Unsolicited. Auto means the PBX will try to automatically determine the type "
"of MWI the phone uses. Solicited means Subscribe 200 then Notify 200. "
"Unsolicited means only Notify 200. No need to Subscribe. Auto is the default "
"and should only be changed if you see errors in the Asterisk logs"
msgstr ""
"訊息等待指示（MWI）有三種類型：自動（Auto）、主動要求（Solicited）與非主動（Unsolicited）。自動表示 PBX 會嘗試自動判斷電話使用的 MWI 類型。主動要求表示先 Subscribe 200 再 Notify 200。非主動表示僅 Notify 200，不需要 Subscribe。自動為預設值，只有在 Asterisk 記錄中看到錯誤時才應變更。"

#: ../core/functions.inc/drivers/PJSip.class.php:296
msgid ""
"For Message Waiting indicators there are two types: Solicited and "
"Unsolicited. Solicited means Subscribe 200 then Notify 200. Unsolicited "
"means only Notify 200. No need to Subscribe. Unsolicited is the default and "
"should only be changed if you see errors in the Asterisk logs"
msgstr ""
"訊息等待指示（MWI）有兩種類型：主動要求（Solicited）與非主動（Unsolicited）。主動要求表示先 Subscribe 200 再 Notify 200。非主動表示僅 Notify 200，不需要 Subscribe。非主動為預設值，只有在 Asterisk 記錄中看到錯誤時才應變更。"

#: amp.i18n.php:372
