#: amp.i18n.php:128
msgid ""
"FreePBX appends versioning tags on the CSS and javascript files and some of "
"the main logo images. The versioning will help force browsers to load new "
"versions of the files when module versions are upgraded. Setting this value "
"to true will try to force these to be loaded to the browser every page load "
"by appending an additional timestamp in the version information. This is "
"useful during development and debugging where changes are being made to "
"javascript and CSS files."
msgstr ""
"FreePBX 會在 CSS 與 javascript 檔案及部分主要標誌圖片上附加版本標記。版本標記有助於在模組版本升級時強制瀏覽器載入檔案的新版本。將此值設為 true 時，會在版本資訊中附加額外的時間戳記，嘗試於每次載入頁面時強制瀏覽器重新載入這些檔案。在修改 javascript 與 CSS 檔案的開發與除錯期間，此功能非常實用。"

