msgstr "閒置"

#: ../core/views/routing/form.php:67
msgid ""
"If CallerID is supplied, the dialed number will only match the prefix + "
"match pattern if the CallerID being transmitted matches this. When "
"extensions make outbound calls, the CallerID will be their extension number "
"and NOT their Outbound CID. The above special matching sequences can be used "
"for CallerID matching similar to other number matches."
msgstr ""
"若提供了來電顯示，則只有在傳輸的來電顯示符合此條件時，撥打的號碼才會符合「前置字元 + 比對樣式」。當分機撥打外撥電話時，來電顯示會是它們的分機號碼，而非它們的外撥 CID。上述特殊比對序列可用於來電顯示比對，方式與其他號碼比對類似。"

#: amp.i18n.php:324
msgid ""
"If Ditech's VQA, Voice Quality application is installed, this setting will "
"be used for all inbound calls. For more information 'core show application "
"VQA' at the Asterisk CLI will show the different settings."
msgstr ""
"若已安裝 Ditech 的 VQA（語音品質）應用程式，此設定將套用於所有來電。如需更多資訊，在 Asterisk CLI 執行 'core show application VQA' 會顯示各項不同的設定。"

#: amp.i18n.php:328
msgid ""
"If Ditech's VQA, Voice Quality application is installed, this setting will "
"be used for all outbound calls. For more information 'core show application "
"VQA' at the Asterisk CLI will show the different settings."
msgstr ""
"若已安裝 Ditech 的 VQA（語音品質）應用程式，此設定將套用於所有外撥電話。如需更多資訊，在 Asterisk CLI 執行 'core show application VQA' 會顯示各項不同的設定。"

#: ../core/views/routing/form.php:332
msgid ""
"If checked the extension's Outbound CID will be ignored in favor of this "
"CID. The extension's Emergency CID will still be used if the route is an "
"Emergency Route and the Extension has a defined Emergency CID."
msgstr "若勾選，分機的外撥 CID 將被忽略，改以此 CID 為準。若路由是緊急路由，且分機已定義緊急 CID，則分機的緊急 CID 仍會被使用。"

#: ../core/views/trunks/trunk_header.php:79
msgid ""
"If checked, supply the name of a custom AGI Script that will be called to "
"report, log, email or otherwise take some action on trunk failures that are "
"not caused by either NOANSWER or CANCEL."
msgstr ""
"若勾選，請提供自訂 AGI 指令稿的名稱；該指令稿將被呼叫，以針對非由 NOANSWER 或 CANCEL 造成的中繼失敗進行回報、記錄、寄送電子郵件或採取其他動作。"

#: amp.i18n.php:492
msgid ""
"If enabled the intuitive Dial Patterns boxes on the Routing and Trunks pages "
"will be replaced with a text box which restores the functionality from "
"FreePBX 2.7 and lower."
msgstr "若啟用，路由與中繼頁面上直覺式的「撥號樣式」方塊將被文字方塊取代，藉此恢復 FreePBX 2.7 及更早版本的功能。"

#: ../core/functions.inc/drivers/Sip.class.php:452
msgid ""
"If enabled, then Asterisk will attempt to use rtcp-mux with whatever it "
"communicates with. Asterisk follows the rules set forth in RFC 5761 with "
"regards to falling back to standard RTCP behavior if the far end does not "
"indicate support for rtcp-mux. As a result the following must be enabled to "
"use WebRTC"
msgstr ""
"若啟用，Asterisk 將嘗試與其通訊的任何對象使用 rtcp-mux。若對端未表示支援 rtcp-mux，Asterisk 會依循 RFC 5761 所訂定的規則，回復為標準 RTCP 行為。因此，若要使用 WebRTC，必須啟用下列項目"

#: amp.i18n.php:500
msgid ""
"If false, then the Destination Registry will not report unknown destinations "
"as errors. This should be left to the default true and custom destinations "
"should be moved into the new custom apps registry."
msgstr ""
"若為 false，目的地登錄（Destination Registry）將不會把未知目的地回報為錯誤。此選項應維持預設值 true，而自訂目的地應移入新的自訂應用程式登錄中。"

#: ../core/Api/Gql/Dids.php:46
#: ../core/Api/Gql/Dids.php:162
#: ../core/Api/Gql/Dids.php:396
#: ../core/views/did/advanced_form.php:443
#: ../core/views/did/basic_form.php:261
msgid ""
"If no CallerID has been received, Privacy Manager will ask the caller to "
"enter their phone number. If an user/extension has Call Screening enabled, "
"the incoming caller will be prompted to say their name when the call reaches "
"the user/extension."
msgstr ""
"若未收到來電顯示，隱私管理員（Privacy Manager）會要求來電者輸入其電話號碼。若使用者/分機啟用了來電篩選（Call Screening），則當來電抵達該使用者/分機時，來電者會被提示說出自己的姓名。"

#: amp.i18n.php:40
msgid ""
"If set to anything other than auto Asterisk will be forced to use the "
"technology set here for all websocket communication. Asterisk can not work "
"with both drivers at the same time!"
msgstr ""
"若設為 auto 以外的任何值，Asterisk 將被迫為所有 websocket 通訊使用此處設定的技術。Asterisk 無法同時使用兩種驅動程式！"

#: amp.i18n.php:292
msgid ""
"If set to true, FreePBX will check if you have chan_dahdi installed. If so, "
"it will automatically use all your ZAP configuration settings (devices and "
"trunks) and silently convert them, under the covers, to DAHDi so no changes "
"are needed. The GUI will continue to refer to these as ZAP but it will use "
"the proper DAHDi channels. This will also keep Zap Channel DIDs working."
msgstr ""
"若設為 true，FreePBX 會檢查您是否已安裝 chan_dahdi。若是，它會自動採用您所有的 ZAP 組態設定（裝置與中繼），並在幕後悄悄地將它們轉換為 DAHDi，因此無需任何變更。GUI 仍會將這些稱為 ZAP，但實際會使用正確的 DAHDi 通道。這也會讓 Zap Channel DID 繼續正常運作。"

#: amp.i18n.php:202
msgid ""
"If set to true, any fixed device associated with a user that has no "
"voicemail configured will have the "
msgstr "若設為 true，則與未設定語音信箱之使用者關聯的任何固定裝置，其 "

#: ../core/views/routing/form.php:537
msgid ""
"If the option 'Call successful' is selected, an email notification will be "
"sent on post answer. Selecting 'Dial pattern matched' will send notification "
"email as soon as the dialled pattern is getting matched, so in this case, "
"the notification may not have correct information about trunk & sent "
"outbound caller id."
msgstr ""
"若選取「Call successful」選項，則會在接聽後寄送電子郵件通知。選取「Dial pattern matched」則會在撥號樣式一被比對到時就寄送通知電子郵件，因此在這種情況下，通知可能不會包含關於中繼與所送出之外撥來電顯示的正確資訊。"

#: amp.i18n.php:132
msgid ""
"If this directory is defined, retrieve_conf will check for a file called "
"<i>retrieve_conf_post_custom</i> and if that file exists, it will be "
"included after other processing thus having full access to the current "
"environment for additional customization."
msgstr ""
"若定義了此目錄，retrieve_conf 會檢查名為 <i>retrieve_conf_post_custom</i> 的檔案；若該檔案存在，它會在其他處理之後被納入，因此可完整存取目前環境以進行額外的自訂。"

#: ../core/views/trunks/pjsip.php:303
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, a “line” parameter is added to the outgoing "
"“Contact” header during registration."
msgstr "若啟用此選項，註冊期間會在輸出的「Contact」標頭中加入「line」參數。"

#: ../core/views/routing/timecond.php:33
#: ../core/views/routing/timecond.php:142
msgid ""
"If this route should only be available during certain times then Select a "
"Time Group created under Time Groups. The route will be ignored outside of "
"times specified in that Time Group. If left as default of Permanent Route "
"then it will always be available."
msgstr ""
"若此路由只應在特定時段可用，請選取在「時段群組」下建立的時段群組。在該時段群組指定的時間之外，路由將被忽略。若維持預設的「永久路由」，則路由將永遠可用。"

#: amp.i18n.php:352
msgid ""
"If this value is set to true, then calls going out your outbound routes that "
"originate from outside your PBX and were subsequently forwarded through a "
"call forward, ring group, follow-me or other means, will have a SIP "
"diversion header added to the call with the original incoming DID assuming "
"there is a DID available. This is useful with some carriers that may require "
"this under certain circumstances."
msgstr ""
"若此值設為 true，則經由您的外撥路由送出、源自 PBX 外部、並隨後透過來電轉接、響鈴群組、跟我來（follow-me）或其他方式轉送的來電，會被加入包含原始來電 DID 的 SIP diversion 標頭（前提是有可用的 DID）。對於某些在特定情況下可能要求此行為的電信業者而言，這很有用。"

#: amp_conf/htdocs/admin/libraries/Api/Gql/Modules.php:171
msgid ""
"If true executes chown command after running module upgradation. By default "
"this is true"
msgstr "若為 true，則在執行模組升級後執行 chown 指令。預設為 true。"

#: amp_conf/htdocs/admin/libraries/Api/Gql/Modules.php:167
