msgstr "若為 true，則在執行模組升級後執行 reload 指令。預設為 true。"

#: amp.i18n.php:332
msgid ""
"If true, Core will not statically generate hints, but instead make a call to "
"the AMPBIN php script, and generate_hints.php through an Asterisk #exec "
"call. This requires asterisk.conf to be configured with <b>execincludes=yes</"
"b> set in the [options] section."
msgstr ""
"若為 true，Core 將不會靜態產生 hints，而是透過 Asterisk 的 #exec 呼叫，呼叫 AMPBIN php 指令稿與 generate_hints.php。這需要 asterisk.conf 在 [options] 區段中設定 <b>execincludes=yes</b>。"

#: amp.i18n.php:554
msgid ""
"If you need to authenticate to the proxy server, you must enter both a "
"username and password. Leaving either (or both) blank disables Proxy "
"Authentication"
msgstr "若您需要向 Proxy 伺服器驗證身分，則必須同時輸入使用者名稱與密碼。將任一欄位（或兩者）留空會停用 Proxy 驗證。"

