#: amp.i18n.php:152
msgid ""
"Module Admin caches a copy of the online XML document that describes what is "
"available on the server. Subsequent online update checks will use the cached "
"information if it is less than 5 minutes old. To bypass the cache and force "
"it to go to the server each time, set this to True. This should normally be "
"false but can be helpful during testing."
msgstr ""
"「模組管理員」會快取一份描述伺服器上可用項目的線上 XML 文件副本。若快取資訊未超過 5 分鐘，後續的線上更新檢查將使用該快取資訊。若要略過快取並強制每次都連至伺服器，請將此設為「True」。正常情況下此值應為「false」，但在測試期間可能有所幫助。"

#: amp.i18n.php:524
msgid ""
"Module Admin normally tries to get its online information through direct "
"file open type calls to URLs that go back to the freepbx.org server. If it "
"fails, typically because of content filters in firewalls that do not like "
"the way PHP formats the requests, the code will fall back and try a wget to "
"pull the information. This will often solve the problem. However, in such "
"environment there can be a significant timeout before the failed file open "
"calls to the URLs return and there are often 2-3 of these that occur. "
"Setting this value will force FreePBX to avoid the attempt to open the URL "
"and go straight to the wget calls."
msgstr ""
"「模組管理員」通常會嘗試透過直接開啟 URL 的檔案開啟式呼叫，向 freepbx.org 伺服器取得線上資訊。若此方式失敗（通常是因為防火牆的內容過濾器不喜歡 PHP 格式化要求的方式），程式碼會改為嘗試以 wget 取得資訊，這通常能解決問題。然而，在此類環境中，失敗的 URL 檔案開啟呼叫在傳回前可能會有明顯的逾時，而且這種情況經常會連續發生 2-3 次。設定此值將強制 FreePBX 略過開啟 URL 的嘗試，直接改用 wget 呼叫。"

