#: amp.i18n.php:304
msgid ""
"Normally FreePBX auto-generates a custom context that may be usable for "
"adding custom dialplan to modify the normal behavior of FreePBX. It takes a "
"good understanding of how Asterisk processes these includes to use this and "
"in many of the cases, there is no useful application. All includes will "
"result in a WARNING in the Asterisk log if there is no context found to "
"include though it results in no errors. If you know that you want the "
"includes, you can set this to true. If you comment it out FreePBX will "
"revert to legacy behavior and include the contexts."
msgstr ""
"一般情況下，FreePBX 會自動產生一個自訂情境（context），可用於加入自訂撥號計畫，以修改 FreePBX 的正常行為。要使用此功能，需要充分了解 Asterisk 如何處理這些 include（包含），而且在許多情況下，並沒有實用的應用。若找不到要包含的情境，所有 include 都會在 Asterisk 日誌中產生 WARNING（警告），但不會造成任何錯誤。如果您確定需要這些 include，可以將此值設為 true。若將它註解掉，FreePBX 將回復為舊版行為並包含這些情境。"

#: amp.i18n.php:756
msgid ""
"Normally FreePBX gets the current Asterisk version directly from Asterisk. "
"This is required to generate proper dialplan for a given version. When using "
"some custom Asterisk builds, the version may not be properly parsed and "
"improper dialplan generated. Setting this to an equivalent Asterisk version "
"will override what is read from Asterisk. This SHOULD be left blank unless "
"you know what you are doing."
msgstr ""
"一般情況下，FreePBX 會直接從 Asterisk 取得目前的 Asterisk 版本。這是為特定版本產生正確撥號計畫所必需的。使用某些自訂 Asterisk 建置時，版本可能無法被正確解析，因而產生不正確的撥號計畫。將此值設為一個對應的 Asterisk 版本，即可覆寫從 Asterisk 讀取到的版本。除非您知道自己在做什麼，否則此欄位應保持空白。"

#: amp.i18n.php:14
msgid ""
"Normally the friendly names will be displayed on this page and the internal "
"freepbx_conf configuration names are shown in the tooltip. If you prefer to "
"view the configuration variables, and the friendly name in the tooltip, set "
"this to false.."
msgstr ""
"一般情況下，此頁面會顯示易讀名稱，而內部的 freepbx_conf 設定名稱則顯示在工具提示中。如果您偏好檢視設定變數，並將易讀名稱顯示在工具提示中，請將此值設為 false。"

#: ../core/views/trunks/trunk_header.php:416
msgid ""
"Normally the next trunk is only tried upon a trunk being 'Congested' in some "
"form, or unavailable. Checking this box will force a failed call to always "
"continue to the next configured trunk or destination even when the channel "
"reports BUSY or INVALID NUMBER."
msgstr ""
"一般情況下，只有在前一個中繼以某種形式呈現「壅塞」或無法使用時，才會嘗試下一個中繼。勾選此勾選方塊後，即使通道回報 BUSY 或 INVALID NUMBER，失敗的通話也一定會繼續轉往下一個已設定的中繼或目的地。"

