msgstr "選用：選取「緊急」將強制使用裝置的緊急來電顯示設定（若有設定）。若此路由用於緊急撥號（例如 911），請選取此選項。"

#: ../core/views/routing/form.php:383
msgid ""
"Optional: Selecting Intra-Company will treat this route as an intra-company "
"connection, preserving the internal CallerID information instead of the "
"outbound CID of either the extension or trunk."
msgstr "選用：選取「公司內」會將此路由視為公司內連線，保留內部來電顯示資訊，而非分機或中繼的外撥來電顯示。"

#: amp.i18n.php:256
#: ../core/install.php:461
msgid ""
"Options to be passed to the Asterisk Dial Command when making internal calls "
"or for calls ringing internal phones. The options are documented in Asterisk "
"documentation, a subset of which are described here. The default options T "
"and t allow the calling and called users to transfer a call with ##. If "
"'Disallow transfer features for inbound callers' is set to 'Yes' the T "
"option is removed for inbound callers. The r option allows Asterisk to "
"generate ringing back to the calling phones which is needed by some phones "
"and sometimes needed in complex dialplan features that may otherwise result "
"in silence to the caller. The H and h options allow the in-Call disconnect "
"feature code to function"
msgstr ""
"撥打內部通話或響鈴至內部電話時，要傳遞給 Asterisk Dial 指令的選項。這些選項記載於 Asterisk 文件中，此處僅描述其中一部分。預設選項 T 與 t 允許主叫與被叫使用者使用 ## 轉接通話。若「Disallow transfer features for inbound callers」設為「Yes」，則會對來電者移除 T 選項。r 選項可讓 Asterisk 對主叫電話產生回鈴音，某些電話需要此選項，有時在複雜的撥號計畫功能中也需要，否則主叫方可能會聽到靜音。H 與 h 選項可讓通話中斷線功能簡碼正常運作"

#: amp.i18n.php:260
#: ../core/install.php:477
msgid ""
"Options to be passed to the Asterisk Dial Command when making outbound calls "
"on your trunks when not part of an Intra-Company Route. The options are "
"documented in Asterisk documentation, a subset of which are described here. "
"The default option T allows the calling user to transfer a call with ##. It "
"is HIGHLY DISCOURAGED to use the r option here as this will prevent early "
"media from being delivered from the PSTN and can result in the inability to "
"interact with some external IVRs"
msgstr ""
"在不屬於公司內路由的情況下，透過中繼撥打外撥通話時，要傳遞給 Asterisk Dial 指令的選項。這些選項記載於 Asterisk 文件中，此處僅描述其中一部分。預設選項 T 允許主叫使用者使用 ## 轉接通話。強烈不建議在此使用 r 選項，因為這會阻止 PSTN 傳送早期媒體，並可能導致無法與某些外部 IVR 互動"

