msgid ""
"Sets the extension behavior in FreePBX.If set to <b>extensions</b>, Devices "
"and Users are administered together as a unified Extension, and appear on a "
"single page. If set to <b>deviceanduser</b>, Devices and Users will be "
"administered separately. Devices (e.g. each individual line on a SIP phone) "
