#: amp.i18n.php:404
msgid ""
"Setting this flag will generate the required global variable so that "
"enumlookup.agi will use Google DNS 8.8.8.8 when performing an ENUM lookup. "
"Not all DNS deals with NAPTR record, but Google does. There is a drawback to "
"this as Google tracks every lookup. If you are not comfortable with this, do "
"not enable this setting. Please read Google FAQ about this: <b>http://code."
"google.com/speed/public-dns/faq.html#privacy</b>."
msgstr ""
"設定此旗標將產生必要的全域變數，使 enumlookup.agi 在執行 ENUM 查詢時使用 Google DNS 8.8.8.8。並非所有 DNS 都能處理 NAPTR 記錄，但 Google 可以。此作法有個缺點，就是 Google 會追蹤每次查詢。若您對此感到不妥，請勿啟用此設定。請閱讀 Google 的相關常見問題：<b>http://code.google.com/speed/public-dns/faq.html#privacy</b>。"

#: amp.i18n.php:764
msgid ""
"Setting this to true will allow the development team to use google analytics "
"to anonymously analyze browser information to help make better development "
"decisions. Setting to false will stop the PBX from using google analytics "
"directly, but this option will not control web contents displayed in iframes."
msgstr ""
"設定為 true 將允許開發團隊使用 Google Analytics 匿名分析瀏覽器資訊，以協助做出更佳的開發決策。設定為 false 將停止 PBX 直接使用 Google Analytics，但此選項無法控制 iframe 中顯示的網頁內容。"

#: amp.i18n.php:22
msgid ""
"Setting this to true will allow you to override un-hidden readonly setting "
"to change them. Settings that are readonly may be extremely volatile and "
"have a high chance of breaking your system if you change them. Take extreme "
"caution when electing to make such changes."
msgstr ""
"設定為 true 將允許您覆寫未隱藏的唯讀設定並加以變更。唯讀設定可能極不穩定，變更它們有很高的機率會破壞您的系統。選擇進行此類變更時請務必格外謹慎。"

#: amp.i18n.php:156
msgid "Setting this to true will expose the "
msgstr "設定為 true 將公開 "

#: amp.i18n.php:828
msgid ""
"Setting this to true will fetch system javascript libraries such as jQuery "
"and jQuery-ui from ajax.googleapis.com. This can be advantageous if "
"accessing remote or multiple different FreePBX systems since the libraries "
"are only cached once in your browser. If external internet connections are "
"problematic, setting this true could result in slow systems. FreePBX will "
"always fallback to the locally available libraries if the CDN is not "
"available."
msgstr ""
"設定為 true 將從 ajax.googleapis.com 取得系統的 JavaScript 程式庫，例如 jQuery 與 jQuery-ui。若您要存取遠端或多個不同的 FreePBX 系統，這會很有幫助，因為這些程式庫只需在您的瀏覽器中快取一次。若外部網際網路連線有問題，將此設定為 true 可能導致系統變慢。若 CDN 無法使用，FreePBX 一律會改回使用本機可用的程式庫。"

#: ../core/functions.inc/drivers/Sip.class.php:398
msgid ""
"Setting to yes (equivalent to 2000 msec) will send an OPTIONS packet to the "
"endpoint periodically (default every minute). Used to monitor the health of "
"the endpoint. If delays are longer then the qualify time, the endpoint will "
"be taken offline and considered unreachable. Can be set to a value which is "
"the msec threshhold. Setting to no will turn this off. Can also be helpful "
"to keep NAT pinholes open."
msgstr ""
"設定為 yes（等同於 2000 毫秒）將定期傳送 OPTIONS 封包至端點（預設每分鐘一次），用於監控端點的健康狀態。若延遲時間超過資格檢查時間，端點將被判定為離線且無法連線。可設定為毫秒門檻值。設定為 no 將關閉此功能。此設定亦有助於保持 NAT 針孔通道開啟。"

#: ../core/functions.inc/drivers/Iax2.class.php:139
msgid ""
"Setting to yes (equivalent to 2000 msec) will send an OPTIONS packet to the "
"endpoint periodically (default every minute). Used to monitor the health of "
"the endpoint. If delays are longer then the qualify time, the endpoint will "
"be taken offline and considered unreachable. Can be set to a value which is "
"the msec threshold. Setting to no will turn this off. Can also be helpful to "
"keep NAT pinholes open."
msgstr ""
"設定為 yes（等同於 2000 毫秒）將定期傳送 OPTIONS 封包至端點（預設每分鐘一次），用於監控端點的健康狀態。若延遲時間超過資格檢查時間，端點將被判定為離線且無法連線。可設定為毫秒門檻值。設定為 no 將關閉此功能。此設定亦有助於保持 NAT 針孔通道開啟。"

