#: ../core/functions.inc/drivers/PJSip.class.php:370
msgid ""
"Some SIP phones (Mitel/Aastra, Snom) expect a sip/frag \"200 OK\" after "
"REFER has been accepted. If set to no then asterisk will not send the "
"progress details, but immediately will send \"200 OK\"."
msgstr ""
"某些 SIP 電話（Mitel/Aastra、Snom）在 REFER 被接受後，會預期收到 sip/frag「200 OK」。若設定為 no，Asterisk 將不會傳送進度詳細資訊，而是立即傳送「200 OK」。"

#: amp.i18n.php:272
msgid ""
"Some carriers will reject a call if a CallerID Name (CNAM) is presented. "
"This occurs in several areas when configuring CID on the PBX using the "
"format of 'CNAM' <CNUM>. To remove the CNAM part of CID on all external "
"trunks, set this value to true. This WILL NOT remove CNAM when a trunk is "
"called from an Intra-Company route. This can be done on each individual "
"trunk in addition to globally if there are trunks where it is desirable to "
"keep CNAM information, though most carriers ignore CNAM."
msgstr ""
"若送出來電顯示名稱（CNAM），有些電信業者會拒絕通話。在 PBX 上使用「CNAM」<CNUM> 的格式設定來電顯示時，會在多個位置發生此情況。若要移除所有外部中繼之來電顯示中的 CNAM 部分，請將此值設定為 true。從公司內部路由呼叫中繼時，此設定不會移除 CNAM。除了全域設定外，若某些中繼希望保留 CNAM 資訊，也可針對個別中繼進行此設定，不過大多數電信業者會忽略 CNAM。"

#: ../core/Api/Gql/Dids.php:54
#: ../core/Api/Gql/Dids.php:170
#: ../core/Api/Gql/Dids.php:407
#: ../core/views/did/advanced_form.php:335
#: ../core/views/did/basic_form.php:183
msgid ""
"Some devices or providers require RINGING to be sent before ANSWER. You'll "
"notice this happening if you can send calls directly to a phone, but if you "
"send it to an IVR, it won't connect the call."
msgstr ""
"某些裝置或電信業者要求在 ANSWER 之前先傳送 RINGING。若您能將通話直接傳送至電話，但傳送至 IVR 時卻無法接通，您就會注意到這種情況。"

#: ../core/functions.inc/drivers/PJSip.class.php:402
msgid "Some extensions must use outbound_auth."
msgstr "某些分機必須使用 outbound_auth。"

#: amp.i18n.php:376
msgid ""
"Some modules allow the CNAM to be prepended. If a previous prepend was done, "
"the default behavior is to remove the previous prepend and only use the most "
"recent one. Setting this to false will turn that off allowing all prepends "
"to be 'stacked' in front of one another."
msgstr ""
"某些模組允許前置 CNAM。若先前已進行前置，預設行為會移除先前的前置內容，僅使用最近的一次。將此設定為 false 可關閉此行為，允許所有前置內容「堆疊」在一起。"

#: amp.i18n.php:368
msgid ""
"Some modules will generate lots of NoOp() commands proceeded by a [TRACE]"
"(trace_level) that can be used during development or while trying to trace "
"call flows. These NoOp() commands serve no other purpose so if you do not "
"want to see excessive NoOp()s in your dialplan you can set this to 0. The "
"higher the number the more detailed level of trace NoOp()s will be generated"
msgstr ""
"某些模組會產生大量前面帶有 [TRACE](trace_level) 的 NoOp() 指令，可在開發期間或嘗試追蹤通話流程時使用。這些 NoOp() 指令沒有其他用途，因此若您不想在撥號計畫中看到過多的 NoOp()，可以將此設定為 0。數字越高，產生的 NoOp() 追蹤層級就越詳細。"

#: amp_conf/htdocs/admin/views/module_admin/httpdRestart.php:2
msgid ""
"Some of the recently updated modules needs apache service to restart to work "
"properly, so please restart the apache service."
msgstr "部分最近更新的模組需要重新啟動 Apache 服務才能正常運作，因此請重新啟動 Apache 服務。"

