#: amp_conf/htdocs/admin/views/oobe.php:39
#, php-format
msgid "Welcome to %s!"
msgstr "歡迎使用 %s！"

#: amp_conf/htdocs/admin/libraries/utility.functions.php:1076
msgid "What Does this Mean?"
msgstr "這是什麼意思？"

#: amp.i18n.php:408
msgid ""
"When Asterisk is stopped or restarted with the 'amportal stop/restart' "
"commands, it does a graceful stop waiting for active channels to hangup. "
"This sets the maximum time in seconds to wait prior to force stopping "
"Asterisk"
msgstr ""
"當使用「amportal stop/restart」命令停止或重新啟動 Asterisk 時，它會優雅地停止並等待作用中通道掛斷。此設定為強制停止 Asterisk 前的最大等待秒數"

#: amp.i18n.php:380
msgid ""
"When Asterisk is stopped or restarted with the 'amportal stop/restart' "
"commands, it does a graceful stop waiting for active channels to hangup. "
"This sets the polling interval to check if Asterisk is shutdown and update "
"the countdown timer."
msgstr ""
"當使用「amportal stop/restart」命令停止或重新啟動 Asterisk 時，它會優雅地停止並等待作用中通道掛斷。此設定為輪詢間隔，用以檢查 Asterisk 是否已關閉並更新倒數計時器。"

#: ../core/functions.inc.php:4986
msgid ""
"When Enabled send back a call waiting tone when this user is called and is "
"busy"
msgstr "啟用後，當此使用者被呼叫且忙線時，會回傳話中插接提示音"

#: amp.i18n.php:752
msgid ""
"When Set to True, admin access to the FreePBX GUI will be allowed using the "
"FreePBX configured AMPDBUSER and AMPDBPASS credentials. This only applies "
"when Authorization Type is 'database' mode."
msgstr ""
"設為 True 時，將允許使用 FreePBX 所設定的 AMPDBUSER 與 AMPDBPASS 憑證存取 FreePBX GUI 的管理員功能。此設定僅在授權類型為「database」模式時適用。"

#: amp.i18n.php:516
msgid ""
"When creating a new sip extension this sets the max size of the generated "
"secret. This generally should be default."
msgstr "建立新的 sip 分機時，此設定為所產生密鑰的最大長度。一般而言應維持預設值。"

#: amp.i18n.php:364
#: ../core/install.php:206
msgid ""
"When enabled all AGI() calls that launch local scripts will instead launch "
"through a FastAGI subprocess. In certain environments this can cause "
"performance improvements. Any AGIs that already called upon agi:// will be "
"unaffected"
msgstr ""
"啟用後，所有啟動本機指令碼的 AGI() 呼叫都將改由 FastAGI 子程序啟動。在某些環境中這可提升效能。已透過 agi:// 呼叫的 AGI 將不受影響"

#: amp.i18n.php:700
msgid ""
"When enabled all notification updates to the Dashboard notification panel "
"will also be logged into the specified log file when enabled."
msgstr "啟用後，所有傳送至儀表板通知面板的通知更新也將在啟用時記錄至指定的記錄檔。"

#: amp.i18n.php:720
msgid ""
"When enabled will turn on PHP Console for error debugging https://github.com/"
"barbushin/php-console"
msgstr "啟用後將開啟 PHP Console 以進行錯誤除錯 https://github.com/barbushin/php-console"

#: ../core/functions.inc/drivers/PJSip.class.php:309
msgid ""
"When enabled, Asterisk condenses message waiting notifications from multiple "
"mailboxes into a single NOTIFY. If it is disabled, individual NOTIFYs are "
"sent for each mailbox."
msgstr "啟用後，Asterisk 會將來自多個信箱的訊息等待通知合併為單一 NOTIFY。停用後，則會為每個信箱分別傳送 NOTIFY。"

#: amp.i18n.php:504
msgid "When set to false, will bypass the confirm on Reload Box."
msgstr "設為 false 時，將略過「重新載入」方塊上的確認。"

#: amp.i18n.php:488
msgid ""
"When set to the default value of true, all requests into FreePBX that might "
"possibly add/edit/delete settings will be validated to assure the request is "
"coming from the server. This will protect the system from CSRF (cross site "
"request forgery) attacks. It will have the effect of preventing legitimately "
"entering URLs that could modify settings which can be allowed by changing "
"this field to false."
msgstr ""
"設為預設值 true 時，所有可能新增、編輯或刪除設定的 FreePBX 要求都將經過驗證，以確保要求確實來自伺服器。這可保護系統免受 CSRF（跨站請求偽造）攻擊。其效果是防止合法輸入可能修改設定的網址；將此欄位改為 false 即可允許此類輸入。"

#: amp.i18n.php:736
msgid ""
"When set to true FreePBX will update its extension map every page load. This "
"is used to check for duplicate extension numbers in the client side "
"javascript validation. Normally the extension map is only created when Apply "
"Configuration Settings is pressed and retrieve_conf is run."
msgstr ""
"設為 true 時，FreePBX 會在每次載入頁面時更新其分機對應表。此對應表用於在使用者端 javascript 驗證中檢查重複的分機號碼。一般情況下，分機對應表只在按下「套用組態設定」並執行 retrieve_conf 時建立。"

#: amp.i18n.php:312
#: ../core/install.php:236
msgid ""
"When set to true and when CONNECTEDLINE() capabilities are configured and "
"supported by your handset, the CID value being transmitted on this call will "
"be updated on your handset in the CNAM field prepended with CID: so you know "
"what is being presented to the caller if the outbound trunk supports and "
"honors setting the transmitted CID."
msgstr ""
"設為 true 且您的話機已設定並支援 CONNECTEDLINE() 功能時，本次通話所傳送的 CID 值將在話機的 CNAM 欄位中更新，並在前面加上 CID: 前置碼，因此若外撥中繼支援並遵循所傳送 CID 的設定，您就能得知目前顯示給來電者的內容。"

#: amp.i18n.php:320
#: ../core/install.php:528
msgid ""
"When set to true and when CONNECTEDLINE() capabilities are configured and "
"supported by your handset, the name displayed will include the presence "
"state of the callee."
msgstr "設為 true 且您的話機已設定並支援 CONNECTEDLINE() 功能時，顯示的名稱將包含被叫方的在線狀態。"

#: amp.i18n.php:316
#: ../core/install.php:252
msgid ""
"When set to true and when CONNECTEDLINE() capabilities are configured and "
"supported by your handset, the number actually dialled will be updated on "
"your handset in the CNUM field. This allows you to see the final "
"manipulation of your number after outbound route and trunk dial manipulation "
"rules have been applied. For example, if you have configured 7 digit dialing "
"on a North America dialplan, the ultimate 10 or 11 digit transmission will "
"be displayed back. Any 'Outbound Dial Prefixes' configured at the trunk "
"level will NOT be shown as these are foten analog line pauses (w) or other "
"characters that distort the CNUM field on updates."
msgstr ""
"設為 true 且您的話機已設定並支援 CONNECTEDLINE() 功能時，實際撥打的號碼將更新至話機的 CNUM 欄位。這可讓您看到號碼在套用外撥路由與中繼撥號修改規則後的最終處理結果。例如，若您在北美洲撥號規則中設定了 7 位數撥號，最終傳送的 10 或 11 位數將顯示回來。在中繼層級設定的任何「外撥撥號前置碼」將不會顯示，因為這些通常是類比線路暫停（w）或其他會在更新時使 CNUM 欄位失真的字元。"

#: amp.i18n.php:344
msgid ""
"When set to true, a beep is played instead of confirmation message when "
"activating/de-activating: CallForward, CallWaiting, DayNight, DoNotDisturb "
"and FindMeFollow."
msgstr "設為 true 時，在啟用或停用「來電轉接、話中插接、日夜模式、勿打擾與跟隨」時，將播放嗶聲而非確認訊息。"

#: amp.i18n.php:520
msgid ""
"When set to true, the system will check for a freepbx_menu.conf file amongst "
"the normal configuraiton files and if found, it will be used to define and "
"remap the menu tabs and contents. See http://wiki.freepbx.org/x/6YDGAg for "
"more details"
msgstr ""
"設為 true 時，系統會在一般組態檔中尋找 freepbx_menu.conf 檔，若找到，將使用它來定義並重新對應選單分頁與內容。詳情請參閱 http://wiki.freepbx.org/x/6YDGAg"

#: ../core/views/trunks/pjsip.php:845
msgid ""
"When this option is enabled, outbound REGISTER requests will advertise "
"support for Path headers so that intervening proxies can add to the Path "
"header as necessary."
msgstr "啟用此選項時，外撥 REGISTER 要求將宣告支援 Path 標頭，以便中間的代理伺服器視需要加入 Path 標頭。"

#: amp.i18n.php:458
msgid "Where (root) command line scripts are located."
msgstr "命令列指令碼（root）的所在位置。"

#: amp.i18n.php:728
msgid ""
"Where to send PHP errors, warnings and notices by the FreePBX PHP error "
"handler. Set to 'dbug', they will go to the Debug File regardless of whether "
"dbug Loggin is disabled or not. Set to 'freepbxlog' will send them to the "
"FreePBX Log. Set to 'off' and they will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"FreePBX PHP 錯誤處理程式傳送 PHP 錯誤、警告與通知的位置。設為「dbug」時，無論是否停用 dbug 記錄，都會送至除錯檔。設為「freepbxlog」時，將送至 FreePBX 記錄。設為「off」時，則會忽略。"

#: ../core/functions.inc/drivers/Sip.class.php:358
msgid ""
"Whether Asterisk should send RPID (or PAI) info to the device. Usually "
"should be enabled to the settings used by your device for CONNECTEDLINE() "
"functionality to work if supported by the endpoint."
msgstr ""
"是否讓 Asterisk 傳送 RPID（或 PAI）資訊給裝置。通常應根據您裝置所用的設定加以啟用，以便在端點支援時讓 CONNECTEDLINE() 功能正常運作。"

#: amp.i18n.php:28
msgid ""
"Whether Asterisk should serve static content from http-static (HTML pages, "
"CSS, javascript, etc.). Default is no."
msgstr "是否讓 Asterisk 從 http-static 提供靜態內容（HTML 頁面、CSS、javascript 等）。預設為否。"

#: ../core/functions.inc/drivers/Sip.class.php:332
msgid ""
"Whether Asterisk should trust the RPID settings from this device. Usually "
"should be yes for CONNECTEDLINE() functionality to work if supported by the "
"endpoint."
msgstr "是否讓 Asterisk 信任此裝置的 RPID 設定。通常應為是，以便在端點支援時讓 CONNECTEDLINE() 功能正常運作。"

#: ../core/views/trunks/pjsip.php:928
msgid "Whether NAT support is enabled on UDPTL sessions"
msgstr "是否在 UDPTL 工作階段啟用 NAT 支援"

#: ../core/views/trunks/pjsip.php:872
msgid "Whether T.38 UDPTL support is enabled or not"
msgstr "是否啟用 T.38 UDPTL 支援"

#: amp.i18n.php:684
msgid "Whether or not to invoke the FreePBX log facility."
msgstr "是否呼叫 FreePBX 記錄功能。"

#: amp.i18n.php:32
msgid ""
"Whether the Asterisk HTTP interface is enabled or not. This is for Asterisk, "
"it is not directly related for FreePBX usage and the value of this setting "
"is irrelevant for accessing core FreePBX settings. Default is no."
msgstr ""
"是否啟用 Asterisk HTTP 介面。此設定是針對 Asterisk，與 FreePBX 的使用無直接關聯，且此設定的數值與存取核心 FreePBX 設定無關。預設為否。"

#: ../core/functions.inc/drivers/Sip.class.php:428
msgid ""
"Whether to Enable AVPF. Defaults to no. The WebRTC standard has selected "
"AVPF as the audio video profile to use for media streams. This is not the "
"default profile in use by Asterisk. As a result the following must be "
"enabled to use WebRTC"
msgstr ""
"是否啟用 AVPF。預設為否。WebRTC 標準已選用 AVPF 作為媒體串流所使用的影音設定檔。這並非 Asterisk 目前使用的預設設定檔。因此，若要使用 WebRTC，必須啟用下列項目"

#: ../core/functions.inc/drivers/Sip.class.php:444
msgid ""
"Whether to Enable ICE Support. Defaults to no. ICE (Interactive Connectivity "
"Establishment) is a protocol for Network Address Translator(NAT) traversal "
"for UDP-based multimedia sessions established with the offer/answer model. "
"This option is commonly enabled in WebRTC setups"
msgstr ""
"是否啟用 ICE 支援。預設為否。ICE（互動式連線建立）是以 offer/answer 模式建立之 UDP 多媒體工作階段的網路位址轉譯（NAT）穿透協定。此選項通常在 WebRTC 環境中啟用"

#: amp.i18n.php:336
msgid ""
"Whether to enforce RFC7462 for Alert-Info. With this enabled all Alert Infos "
"will be prefixed with "
msgstr "是否針對 Alert-Info 強制執行 RFC7462。啟用後，所有 Alert Info 皆會加上前置碼 "

#: ../core/functions.inc/drivers/Sip.class.php:459
msgid ""
"Whether to offer SRTP encrypted media (and only SRTP encrypted media) on "
"outgoing calls to a peer. Calls will fail with HANGUPCAUSE=58 if the peer "
"does not support SRTP. Defaults to no."
msgstr ""
"是否在撥給對端的外撥通話中提供 SRTP 加密媒體（且僅限 SRTP 加密媒體）。若對端不支援 SRTP，通話將以 HANGUPCAUSE=58 失敗。預設為否。"

#: ../core/functions.inc/drivers/Dahdi.class.php:121
msgid ""
"Whether to turn on echo cancellation when bridging between DAHDi channels. "
"See DAHDi documentation for details."
msgstr "在 DAHDi 通道之間橋接時，是否要開啟回音消除。詳細資訊請參閱 DAHDi 文件。"

#: amp_conf/htdocs/admin/views/module_admin/unable-to-sysupdate.php:154
msgid "Why are packages held?"
msgstr "為何套件會被鎖定？"

#: amp_conf/htdocs/admin/libraries/Console/Kvstore.class.php:18
msgid ""
"With great power comes great responsibility. This command can potentially "
"break things. Unless you pass this parameter it is readonly"
msgstr "能力越大，責任越大。此命令可能會破壞系統。除非您傳入此參數，否則它是唯讀的。"

#: ../core/functions.inc/drivers/PJSip.class.php:316
msgid ""
"With this option enabled, Asterisk will attempt to negotiate the use of "
"bundle. If negotiated this will result in multiple RTP streams being carried "
"over the same underlying transport. Note that enabling bundle will also "
"enable the rtcp_mux option"
msgstr ""
"啟用此選項後，Asterisk 將嘗試協商使用 bundle。若協商成功，多個 RTP 串流將透過同一個底層傳輸來承載。請注意，啟用 bundle 也會一併啟用 rtcp_mux 選項。"

#: amp_conf/htdocs/admin/libraries/Builtin/SystemUpdates.php:665
msgid "Working"
msgstr "處理中"

