#: amp_conf/htdocs/admin/views/zend_config.php:3
msgid ""
"You are attempting to load licensed modules without a proper Zend Guard "
"Configuration. Please ensure you have Zend Guard installed on your system "
"and have downloaded a license via the System Administration module."
msgstr ""
"您正嘗試在沒有正確 Zend Guard 設定的情況下載入授權模組。請確認您的系統已安裝 Zend Guard，並已透過「系統管理」（System Administration）模組下載授權。"

#: amp_conf/htdocs/admin/views/bad_refferer.php:17
msgid ""
"You are attempting to modify settings from a URL that does not appear to "
"have come from a FreePBX page link or button. This can occur if you manually "
"typed in the URL below. This action has been blocked because the "
"HTTP_REFERER does not match your current SERVER. If you require this access, "
"you can set Check Server Referrer=false in Advanced Settings to disable this "
"security check"
msgstr ""
"您正嘗試從一個看似並非來自 FreePBX 頁面連結或按鈕的 URL 修改設定。如果您在下方手動輸入 URL，就可能發生這種情況。由於 HTTP_REFERER 與您目前的 SERVER 不符，此操作已被封鎖。若您需要此存取權限，可以在「進階設定」中將「Check Server Referrer」設為 false，以停用此安全檢查。"

#: amp_conf/htdocs/admin/libraries/BMO/Media.class.php:84
#, php-format
msgid ""
"You are missing support for the following HTML5 codecs: %s. To fully support "
"HTML5 browser playback you will need to install programs that can not be "
"distributed with %s. If you'd like to install the binaries needed for these "
"conversions click 'Resolve' in the lower left corner of this message. You "
"can also safely ignore this message but browser playback might not work in "
"your browser."
msgstr ""
"您缺少下列 HTML5 編解碼器的支援：%s。若要完整支援 HTML5 瀏覽器播放，您需要安裝無法隨 %s 一同散布的程式。若您想安裝這些轉換所需的二進位檔，請按一下本訊息左下角的「Resolve」。您也可以放心忽略此訊息，但瀏覽器播放可能無法在您的瀏覽器中正常運作。"

#: amp_conf/htdocs/admin/libraries/Console/Reload.class.php:381
msgid ""
"You are set to Device and User mode but are not set to 'Dynamically Generate "
"Hints' which can result in improper phone state behavior. This can be "
"changed on the Advanced Settings page, check the tooltip for specific "
"configuration details."
msgstr ""
"您已設定為裝置與使用者（Device and User）模式，但未設定「Dynamically Generate Hints」，這可能導致手機狀態行為異常。您可以在「進階設定」頁面變更此設定，請查看工具提示以了解具體的設定細節。"

#: ../core/page.advancedsettings.php:301
msgid "You are urged to backup before making any changes."
msgstr "強烈建議您在進行任何變更之前先備份。"

#: amp_conf/htdocs/admin/libraries/BMO/Framework.class.php:241
#: amp_conf/htdocs/admin/libraries/Console/Reload.class.php:361
msgid ""
"You are using the default Asterisk Manager password that is widely known, "
"you should set a secure password"
msgstr "您目前使用的是廣為人知的 Asterisk Manager 預設密碼，您應設定一個安全密碼。"

#: amp_conf/htdocs/admin/libraries/Console/Motd.class.php:90
msgid ""
"You can access the GUI by typing one of the above IPs in to your web browser."
msgstr "您可以在網頁瀏覽器中輸入上述任一 IP 位址來存取 GUI。"

#: ../core/views/trunks/trunk_header.php:96
msgid ""
